.el .ds Aq '
.TH portensor-distributed 1  "distributed "
.SH NAME
portensor\-distributed \- Plan, coordinate, or execute distributed scans across multiple hosts
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBdistributed\fR [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIsubcommands\fR>
.SH DESCRIPTION
Plan, coordinate, or execute distributed scans across multiple hosts
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.SH SUBCOMMANDS
.TP
portensor\-distributed\-plan(1)
Print a shell script that runs every shard locally and merges the reports
.TP
portensor\-distributed\-serve(1)
Serve a coordinator that assigns shard jobs to polling workers or push agents
.TP
portensor\-distributed\-worker(1)
Poll a coordinator, execute assigned shard scans, and submit the reports
.TP
portensor\-distributed\-agent(1)
Listen for jobs pushed by a coordinator (inbound mode)
.TP
portensor\-distributed\-help(1)
Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)
